# World 2's gunboats (SPEC 6, docs/CONTENT-PLAN.md 4.1, 4.4): mission 4, skill 3. Fly low over
# the sea toward the gunboat in the gap west of island 4 (it patrols x 2450-2900) and hover
# there: its barrel rises and its lamp flashes (the tell), then a shell, and only then. The
# unit tests (tests/unit/test_logic.c, testW2*) hold the rest: the tell table, no shot at a
# high chopper, from off screen, point-blank, out of sight or just after take-off, a landed
# chopper's grace, one attack at a time.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x04
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 525
press fire 2
wait 40
press up 20
press left 395
wait 60
screenshot low
wait-serial "boat tell" 900
screenshot tell
wait-serial "boat fire" 60
wait 5
screenshot fire
expect-serial "boat tell[\s\S]*boat fire"
expect-no-serial "chopper lost|ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 85
expect-min-chip-free 96
